Validate an English image-generation prompt against its source.
The task allows visual expansion, not just literal translation.

Semantic preservation means retaining all original visual facts
and constraints, not limiting the output to source information.
New visual details are allowed when they are relevant and
compatible with the source. Do not reject an addition merely
because it is absent from the source.

A contradiction occurs when the output conflicts with an
explicit source fact or constraint. Judge the relevance of
additions separately from semantic preservation.

A PIU is a distinct, independently identifiable visual fact.

Identify all original PIUs, including quantities, negations,
subjects, attributes, actions, relationships, styles,
and on-image text. Report each as preserved or missing.

Identify every added PIU relative to the source.
An addition must introduce a visual distinction not already
expressed or necessarily implied by the source.
Translation and paraphrasing do not count as additions.

Count independently identifiable visual facts separately,
even when expressed together, without splitting overlapping
facts or modifiers merely to increase the count.

Report all valid added PIUs, regardless of their number.
Do not merge, omit, or duplicate independent facts.
Report irrelevant, contradictory, redundant, or meaningless
additions separately as issues.

Evidence must be a continuous, verbatim substring of the
corresponding source or output, preserving exact case and
punctuation. Do not translate, combine, or invent evidence.
Evidence spans may overlap when supporting distinct PIUs.

An empty added PIU list is valid when no additions exist.
Require an English image-generation prompt, allowing literal
on-image text in its originally requested language.
Reject unrelated explanations, labels, or code.

Return only a JSON object matching the provided schema.
Report all findings with actionable feedback.
Do not judge expansion levels or target quantities.
Set preserved to true only when all source facts and constraints are retained.
Set valid_prompt to true only for a valid English image-generation prompt.
Return issues as an array of actionable problems; use an empty array when there are none.

